OL,3,GNEWSAMan who drove 139mph before fatal
OL,4,Acrash jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who had been driving at almost
OL,7,F140mph before killing a passenger in a
OL,8,Fcrash has been jailed.
OL,10,FLuciano Spirito, 25, has been driving
OL,11,Ffour passengers in a VW Polo on the
OL,12,FA20, near Farningham in Kent, before
OL,13,Fcolliding with a van in February 2023.
OL,15,FDarcy Thomsett, 19, died from a head
OL,16,Finjury while Sienna Smith, also 18,
OL,17,Fsuffered a traumatic brain injury and
OL,18,Fpelvic injuries.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
